        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Adelaide Football Club, Hawthorn Football Club, Port Melbourne Football Club, AFL, Victorian Football League\n- People: Neil Craig, Gary Ayres\n- Events: 2009 AFL season, 2010 AFL season\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Neil Craig took over from Gary Ayres as coach of the Adelaide Football Club.\n- The 2010 AFL season was the Adelaide Football Club's 20th season in the AFL.\n- The Adelaide Football Club entered the 2010 AFL season after finishing 5th and exiting in the semi-final of the 2009 AFL season.\n- The 2010 AFL season was Neil Craig's 7th season as coach of the Adelaide Football Club.\n- Gary Ayres was born on 28 September 1960.\n- Gary Ayres is a former Australian rules footballer for the Hawthorn Football Club.\n- Gary Ayres is the senior coach of the Port Melbourne Football Club in the Victorian Football League.",
